                "text": "If we don\u2019t act, 4.2 million Americans will lose their health care coverage because they won't be able to afford it.\n\nToday, with @RepJenKiggans and a total group of 35 House Democrats & Republicans, I announced a new bipartisan framework for health insurance premium savings. https://t.co/96BJ8fHO5g",
